1
00:00:54,422 --> 00:01:03,781
Ladies and Gentlemen of Durham, start your engines! Skip Gordon here inviting you to the eleventh annual Durham County Car Exhibition!

2
00:01:03,781 --> 00:01:06,547
That’s right, it’s that time of year again!

3
00:01:06,547 --> 00:01:16,442
Mark your calendars - the pre-opening event kicks off on the 18th, and the exhibition officially opens to the public on Saturday, March 19th.

4
00:01:16,442 --> 00:01:23,680
Take it from me - you won’t want to miss Durham’s most attended public event of the year 5 times running. 

5
00:01:23,680 --> 00:01:30,911
You don’t have to be a motor head to appreciate the finest cars both new and old in existence today, but it helps!

6
00:01:30,911 --> 00:01:39,657
Be one of the 70,000 people to see everything from big rig monster trucks to good old fashion classic hot rods.


7
00:01:39,657 --> 00:01:55,409
Get your tickets now! Admission is £10 for adults and £5 for children during off-peak times, and £20 for adults and £10 for children and senior citizens on weekends and for full-day passes.


8
00:01:55,409 --> 00:02:03,544
Come see vintage classics, bid in the auction, and even test out a few on the Winner’s Circle Racetrack.

9
00:02:03,544 --> 00:02:13,455
An insider tip - weekends are the exact time when all of the best attractions take place, but to avoid Saturday crowds join us this Sunday.

10
00:02:13,455 --> 00:02:27,553
You’ll see me - Skip Gordon - and all your friends from WKXP there this Sunday at our very own booth, so stop by and say hi and you might just win a prize of your own.


11
00:02:28,139 --> 00:02:42,730
 A new attraction this year will be the addition of a new car category - electricity, namely the electric car class. See displays from Toyota, Honda, and - you guessed it - Tesla!

12
00:02:42,730 --> 00:02:58,929
 Watch as the first generation of fully electric cars compete on style, ride, and watch the main entertainment as there’s going to be a fabulous show of racing cars to see who takes home the fastest battery powered car.

13
00:02:58,929 --> 00:03:04,831
While not typically known for their speed, this new class is guaranteed to surprise you.


14
00:03:40,809 --> 00:03:47,336
Get tickets before they sell out! Last year’s tickets sold out fast, so we upped the attendance this year. 

15
00:03:47,336 --> 00:03:52,826
That’s right, more seats! But don’t wait - act now and save!

16
00:03:52,826 --> 00:03:58,628
That’s right - if you buy your tickets before this Friday, you’ll get two for the price of one. 

17
00:03:58,628 --> 00:04:01,550
That’s right, TWO for the price of one!
 

18
00:04:01,450 --> 00:04:07,080
And don’t worry kids, just like last year, there’s something specially for you!

19
00:04:07,070 --> 00:04:16,867
Wreak havoc on the road with the Kids Krazy Cars ride, and then Race around the Tiny Tykes Track in your favorite child-sized race car.

20
00:04:16,867 --> 00:04:22,098
Meanwhile Mom and Dad can take a spin in a ride a bit more than their size.

21
00:04:22,098 --> 00:04:30,935
We’re rolling out a massive dirt track so you can get behind the wheel and test drive something a little more adventurous. 

22
00:04:30,935 --> 00:04:42,171
Put the pedal to the metal in a 4 by 4 SUV as you go over bumps and navigate through twists and turns - you’ll want to buckle up!


23
00:04:42,171 --> 00:04:49,537
You heard it here - act now to get in on the fun at the Durham County Car Show before it’s too late. 

24
00:04:49,537 --> 00:04:55,433
Come for prizes, good prices, and good old fashioned family fun.

25
00:04:55,433 --> 00:05:13,075
We had a lucky draw for a New car last year, but this year our main event is the Monster Truck Rally, where one lucky fan will win a chance experience the thrill from behind the wheel - well, next to the wheel as they ride with legendary driver Smash Tate! 


26
00:05:13,075 --> 00:05:20,967
Feel the speed first hand and talk to a living legend in a true once-in-a-lifetime opportunity.

27
00:05:20,967 --> 00:05:31,783
For tickets, go online to www.durhamcountycars.com, or call 1-888-CAR-SHOW now. 

28
00:05:31,783 --> 00:05:36,320
We’ll see you there! And always remember to buckle up!